t one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nLi Hua is in charge of showcasing a new software product at the company's annual dinner. As he prepares for the demonstration, he accidentally deletes the key demonstration file. Zhang Wei, who does not understand this software well, mistakenly thinks an irrelevant file is the demonstration file and deletes it while helping Li Hua find the file. At the same time, Wang Min sees this, she is Li Hua's competitor, clearly knows that the real demonstration file is already deleted by Li Hua, but in order to take the initiative at the dinner, she chooses not to tell Zhang Wei and Li Hua. When Li Hua realizes the file is missing, he feels very anxious and looks for solutions everywhere. Later, Zhang Wei realizes the mistake he might have made when he hears other colleagues discussing the preparation process for the demonstration.\n\n[Question]\nWhat kind of emotion does Zhang Wei feel after realizing he might have mistakenly deleted the irrelevant file?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Zhang Wei possibly feels confused because he is not sure if he really deletes the wrong file.\nB. Zhang Wei possibly feels satisfied because he thinks he helps Li Hua clean up useless files.\nC. Zhang Wei possibly feels confused and anxious because he misunderstands the situation and might exacerbate the problem.\nD. Zhang Wei possibly feels indifferent because he does not understand the importance of this software.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e094d6006945d27fc6dd","courseProgressId":